# Paste your latest curl command from Chrome DevTools below.
# Anything works — a feed curl, a kudo curl, whatever — as long as it has
# your -b '...' cookie string and -H 'X-CSRF-Token: ...' header.
#
# How to refresh:
#   1. Open https://www.strava.com/dashboard in Chrome
#   2. DevTools → Network tab → find any /dashboard/feed request
#   3. Right-click → Copy → Copy as cURL
#   4. Replace everything below this line with the pasted curl
#   5. Save. Next run picks it up automatically.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

curl --url 'https://www.strava.com/dashboard/feed?feed_type=following&cursor=1789284434952' \
  -H 'sec-ch-ua-platform: "macOS"' \

